find f : function (size 8, surjective) int(1..10) --> int(1..3)
find b : function (total, bijective) int(1..2) --> int(5..6)
letting D be domain int(1..2, 4..5)
such that
    |defined(f)| >= 0,
    |range(f)| >= 0,
    |preImage(f, 1)| >= 0,
    |preImage(b, 7)| >= 0,
    |restrict(f, D)| >= 0,
    |range(restrict(b, D))| >= 0,
    |toSet(b)| >= 0
